Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:18.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,《黑镜》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.98,0:00:28.98,Title,0,0,0,0,,《暗黑博物馆》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.98,0:02:26.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（充电需时 03：11：48）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.30,0:02:43.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（暗黑博物馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.74,0:02:54.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（开展时间 上午11点）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.38,0:03:23.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（暗黑博物馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.64,0:05:43.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（系统故障）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.73,0:34:24.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一千五百万的价值）
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.22,0:55:31.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（对象已就绪）
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.62,1:05:07.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（可取纪念品）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.54,0:01:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我生来就是要爱你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I was born to love you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.82,0:01:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我永远无法解脱 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And I will never be free ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.85,0:01:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你会永远是我的一部分 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You'll always be a part of me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.47,0:03:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,11点才开 你最早 今天人一定很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tours begin at 11. You're the first in line. Could be a busy day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.48,0:03:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,大道上没什么人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Road seemed pretty empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.11,0:03:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,口音挺带劲 澳大利亚人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice accent. You from Australia?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.46,0:03:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 英国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm from Britain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.14,0:03:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你八成叫那种特拗口的英式名字吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you got one of those crazy British names?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.44,0:03:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丝美拉达之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Esmeralda or, uh…?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.49,0:03:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就叫妮什\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Nish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.84,0:03:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就妮什 - 妮什\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nish? - Nish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.03,0:04:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没资格说你 我的名字就特逗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can't judge. My name's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.65,0:04:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗洛·海恩斯 馆主兼业主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rolo Haynes. Owner. Proprietor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.72,0:04:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来今早就咱俩 你确定想进去看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, just us two this morning. You sure you wanna do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.39,0:04:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,心脏不强大的可受不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place ain't for the faint-hearted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.45,0:04:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我应该能应付得来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure I can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.70,0:04:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是所有人都能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not everyone can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.14,0:04:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以的话我得看看你包里都装了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I have to peek in your little sack there if that's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.59,0:04:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以 - 这年头谁都不能不防\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's OK. - Can't trust anyone these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.56,0:04:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还得麻烦你从那里过一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you could step through there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.86,0:04:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,金属的东西都装在盒子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything metal, put it in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.28,0:04:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.77,0:04:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺炫啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.47,0:04:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我称之为袖珍机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. I call it fun size.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.67,0:04:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,袖珍 我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fun size. I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.88,0:04:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在机场过安检肯定耗了好半天吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guessing you had a gut full of this security shit at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.58,0:04:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这年头移民局的人可严了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our immigration guys are pretty tight these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.60,0:04:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.81,0:04:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.25,0:05:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始表演吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.40,0:05:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是放假了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you on vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.96,0:05:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是吧 我爸在这一带住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of. My dad lives out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.73,0:05:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是他生日 所以我妈想给他个惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's his birthday, so my mom just wants to surprise him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.52,0:05:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊喜就是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're the surprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.80,0:05:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一部分吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}part of it, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.05,0:05:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你从哪飞过来的 - 盐湖城\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where'd you fly in? - Salt Lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.20,0:05:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从盐湖城赶过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came here from Salt Lake?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.75,0:05:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来打算走走荒野大公路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I thought it'd be nice to drive the back route,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.73,0:05:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我低估了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I underestimated the…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条路可不适合姑娘家自己走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heck of a trip for a girl on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.71,0:05:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是有意拿老眼光看你 - 不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't mean to get old-fashioned on you. - Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.74,0:05:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这看法确实够老套的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is quite old-fashioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里热得跟地狱似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hot as hell in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.77,0:05:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,空调肯定是坏掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}AC must've shit the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.45,0:05:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉这么热\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry for the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.35,0:05:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的数字控制系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn digital systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.01,0:05:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞技术的人都不可信 我最清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never trust a guy in tech. Jesus, I should know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.95,0:05:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这堆东西都是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what is all this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.87,0:05:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,真实犯罪物品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Authentic criminological artifacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.20,0:05:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它做了什么坏事 八成就会收进这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it did something bad, chances are it's in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好看 仔细看 看什么能把你吓一跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look around, take your time, see what pops out at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.99,0:06:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有兴趣的 我都能给你详细讲讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything piques your interest, I can tell you all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.48,0:06:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个物件背后都有悲伤又变态的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a sad, sick story behind most everything here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.42,0:06:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如我们的主展品 就在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like our main attraction just through there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.41,0:06:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过一步一步按顺序看\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let's not get ahead of ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.77,0:06:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多人急着直接去参观帘子后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of folks just rush behind the curtain,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.02,0:06:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,其余的连看都不怎么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}hardly even eyeball this stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.20,0:06:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后「大众放屁」之类的应用上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then it's a bunch of one-star.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.54,0:06:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会给你来一堆一星差评\N{\fnArial\fs30}ratings on Trip-fucker and before you know it…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.35,0:06:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我一点都不急 所以你别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, look, I am not in a rush, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.63,0:06:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你慢慢看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.80,0:06:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些东西似乎挺高科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}This stuff looks techie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.34,0:06:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的学术背景是神经科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, neuro tech was my background.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.14,0:06:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.28,0:06:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这个是什么 看起来像个做发型的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's this, then? Looks like a hairdressing thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.87,0:06:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实这是我最早的一批藏品之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, that was one of my very first souvenirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.78,0:06:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让你明白主展品是怎么来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheds a little light on how our main exhibit came to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.10,0:06:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么 - 你听说过彼得·道森吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - You heard of Peter Dawson?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.51,0:06:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得·道森医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Peter Dawson?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.86,0:07:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一般会介绍说这是道森联感诊断器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, usually I say this is Dawson's Symphatic Diagnoser,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.99,0:07:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后观众大惊「不可能」 然后我说「就是」\N{\fnArial\fs30}and folks shriek, "No way, " and I'm like, "Oh, it very much is."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.02,0:07:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个问题一般是「你是怎么搞到的」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"How the heck did you get that?" is the next question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.95,0:07:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 我主攻医疗科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK. - My domain was med tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.57,0:07:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾在圣朱尼佩医院工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worked out of St. Juniper's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.20,0:07:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点像大学医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of like a university hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.03,0:07:20.69,Title,0,0,0,0,,地段特好 《土地法案》的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet setup. Part of the Land Act, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.36,0:07:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在纽约市区 挺老的一栋大楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was in downtown New York, big old building.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.21,0:07:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,研究所在高层\N{\fnArial\fs30}Research up top,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.58,0:07:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,急诊室和平头百姓去的地方则在沿街的低层\N{\fnArial\fs30}emergency room and the great unwashed down at street level.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.97,0:07:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里完美结合了生意和医疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the perfect mix of business and health care.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.27,0:07:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是吧你 - 别挡路 傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seriously? - Out of the way, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.01,0:07:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,经营理念是给没医保的人免费投保\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idea was folks with no coverage signed up for free health care.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.14,0:07:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为交换 他们要同意偶尔参加实验性治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}in exchange for consenting to occasional experimental treatments.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.80,0:07:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给高层的人干活儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I… I worked for the guys up top.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.68,0:07:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像个科学家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, like a scientist?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更像是个 招人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was more sort of… recruitment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来了 - 离手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, yeah, I'm here. - Clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.38,0:07:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,放电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.99,0:08:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没反应 - 没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - No?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.03,0:08:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 那我再来 离手 离手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - OK, I'm going again. Clear. Clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.90,0:08:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,放电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.62,0:08:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.21,0:08:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,早知道她服了三环素 我会加大剂量的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'd known she was on tricyclics, I would have nudged the dose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.19,0:08:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这无法预料\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.15,0:08:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太是时候吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This a bad time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.45,0:08:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,10层的罗洛·海恩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rolo Haynes from the tenth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.07,0:08:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像遇到麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems you've been having some problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.29,0:08:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这里可能有帮得上你的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I got something that can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.32,0:08:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们最感兴趣的就是神经技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}The big thing they're into is neuro technics.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.73,0:08:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,开创性的大脑增强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pioneering brain enhancements.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.85,0:08:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,神经系统联接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neural interfaces.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.92,0:08:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些有意思的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that fun stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的终极目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}The holy grail they've been aiming for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.49,0:08:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是找到传输知识的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a way to transfer knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.82,0:09:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一个小组在做一个实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}So one of the teams here is working on an experiment,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.06,0:09:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,想找到办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to find a way to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.04,0:09:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,将信息从一个大脑发射到另一个大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}beam information from one brain to another.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.42,0:09:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是肯尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Kenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.83,0:09:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是赫克托\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Hector.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.43,0:09:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.30,0:09:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说说这个实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.61,0:09:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们造了一个小迷宫 然后把肯尼放了进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They built a little maze and they drop Kenny here into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.59,0:09:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在里面转来转去转了几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he runs round over and over for months on end.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.16,0:09:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到它对那里了如指掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}till he knows it like a childhood home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.22,0:09:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 他们把这个戴在它身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then… they put this on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.92,0:09:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个发射器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a transmitter,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,从肯尼的大脑中提取信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}absorbing signals from Kenny's brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.47,0:09:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,传给那边的赫克托\N{\fnArial\fs30}which were sent to Hector over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.11,0:09:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫克托佩戴着我们的原型突触接收器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hector had our prototype synaptic receiver fitted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.27,0:09:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 赫克托从未踏足过这个迷宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, remember, Hector had never even set paw in the maze.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.91,0:09:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划就是它现在会接收肯尼对迷宫布局的认知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan was he'd now receive Kenny's knowledge of the maze layout.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.72,0:09:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次进来的时候 就瞬间破解迷宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, boom, he'd be able to solve it, first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.33,0:09:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它成功了吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And did he? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.84,0:10:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,像只老鼠一样乱窜 蠢透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scrabbled around like a rat, fucking imbecile.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.31,0:10:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你跟我讲这个干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, um, why are you telling me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.78,0:10:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为正当迷宫实验宣告失败时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because just as it becomes clear that the maze thing's a bust,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.97,0:10:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一位研究员把咖啡泼在肯尼身上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of our researchers spills his coffee on Kenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.69,0:10:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚烫的咖啡泼了肯尼一身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot coffee spills all over Kenny,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.43,0:10:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,它当然就大声惨叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}so obviously he's squealing like hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.53,0:10:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但赫克托也是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}but so is Hector.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.23,0:10:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果发现 我们没有发现如何分享知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out, we haven't discovered how to share knowledge…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.19,0:10:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但发现了如何分享生理感觉 - 答对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But physical sensations. - Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.82,0:10:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可思议 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's nuts. Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.31,0:10:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,更不可思议的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even nutsier shit,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.27,0:10:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫克托有烫伤感 但并没有任何损伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hector felt the burn, but took no damage at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.69,0:10:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉一模一样 但生理上却毫发无伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of the experience, none of the physical cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.46,0:10:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那它是怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how did he die?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.70,0:10:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后他们把它解剖了检查它身体是否有异样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They cut him open after to see if he was OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 多亏了赫克托的牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyhow, thanks to Hector's sacrifice,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.70,0:10:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做出了这个原型机\N{\fnArial\fs30}we prototyped this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.67,0:10:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类感受接收器\N{\fnArial\fs30}A receiver for human experiences.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.99,0:11:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,神经系统植入物 只有这么一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}A neural implant. Only one of its kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.14,0:11:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你带我来这里的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why you brought me up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.43,0:11:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,诊治病人最烦人的事是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the biggest pain in the ass with patients?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.65,0:11:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难查明他们的病症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finding out what's wrong with them in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.08,0:11:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,半数来这儿的混蛋们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half of the assholes that roll in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.28,0:11:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,连自己的症状都说不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}can't even describe their symptoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.15,0:11:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要么是失去了知觉 或是得了脑震荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're… They're out cold or concussed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.91,0:11:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是醉酒 太蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}or drunk or dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.22,0:11:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有两岁 不会说英语\N{\fnArial\fs30}or… two years old, or they can't speak English.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.14,0:11:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象一下 如果你能原样感受到病人的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine if you could feel exactly what a patient feels,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.16,0:11:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不会有生理症状\N{\fnArial\fs30}minus the physical consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.29,0:11:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像读取他们的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like reading their minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.36,0:11:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.10,0:11:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,真得佩服道森 他立刻抓住了机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta hand it to Dawson, he lept at the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.32,0:11:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很乐意这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, he was happy to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.56,0:11:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且手术过程很短\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was only a short procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.69,0:11:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不可逆的 但 他可是个先锋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Irreversible, but, hey, he was a pioneer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.78,0:11:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说 他的病人死亡率高得离奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, his mortality rates were in the toilet,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.80,0:11:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他赎罪的最好机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}so this was his best shot at redemption.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.95,0:12:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我碰它会疼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it hurt if I touch it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.67,0:12:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该不疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.15,0:12:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来有点重口\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something kinda kinky about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.85,0:12:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像终极穿环\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like the ultimate piercing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是在安慰我 你成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're trying to make me feel better, it's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.98,0:12:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,该试验运行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for the trial run.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.30,0:12:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这时我们的发网装置就该登场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is where our hairnet doohickey comes into play.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.35,0:12:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上讲 如果你把它戴在自愿对象上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theory was, if you slipped it on a willing subject,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.95,0:12:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就会提取他们的生理感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'd absorb their physical sensations.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.80,0:12:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,将其传送至道森的植入器上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and relay them to Dawson's implant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.07,0:12:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只需判断它是否起效\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just had to find out if it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.39,0:12:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这根手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.20,0:12:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,休斯顿 我们创造奇迹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Houston, we got a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.14,0:12:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,道森立刻开始诊治病患\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right off the bat, dawson gets to work with the ailing public,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.64,0:12:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始建立生理症状的心理库\N{\fnArial\fs30}starts building up a kind of mental library of physical symptoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.93,0:13:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划是 他能了解病症的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan was, he'd get to know how things felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.95,0:13:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后更快地做出诊断\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that he could diagnose them quicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.12,0:13:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,先从急诊室的小病开始 轻微骨折之类\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, starts small in the ER, minor fractures, that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,熟练后开始着手更重的病症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon graduates to bigger stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.39,0:13:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,严重受伤 各种疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Major injuries. Diseases.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.03,0:13:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚期患者等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Late-stage terminal stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.69,0:13:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,道森咬牙坚持了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawson grit his teeth and went through it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.23,0:13:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说 一个小孩痛苦不堪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say a kid comes in obviously in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.84,0:13:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生怀疑是阑尾炎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctors suspect appendicitis,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.53,0:13:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们联系道森让他来确诊\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'd hook him up to Dawson just to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.89,0:13:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,道森到这时已多次感受过阑尾炎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawson had felt appendicitis many times by now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.45,0:13:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果还有别的情况他会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he knows if it's something more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.30,0:13:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他发现了他们根本没想到隐疾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caught things they weren't even looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.01,0:13:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,胚细胞瘤等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blastomas and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.77,0:13:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.69,0:13:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他救人无数 毫无疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}That man saved lives, no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.62,0:13:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祝你们好运 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good luck, huh? - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.86,0:13:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 保持联系 再见 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay in touch. Bye-bye. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.28,0:13:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.93,0:13:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, incidentally,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.40,0:13:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,请原谅我如此粗鄙\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you'll allow me to be crude,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.92,0:13:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,道森联感诊断器在床上很有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawson's symphatic diagnoser came in handy in the bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.26,0:14:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的植入物也能接收愉悦的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}His implant received pleasurable sensations, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.65,0:14:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他女朋友戴上蓝色传送头套\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if his girlfriend slipped on that transmitting blue hairnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.51,0:14:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他调好他的小接收植入物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he tuned in his little implant nubbin…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.33,0:14:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不仅能感受到他的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}he didn't just feel what he was feeling…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.21,0:14:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要高潮了 - 还能感受到她的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna come! - …but also felt what she was feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.96,0:14:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这混蛋同时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch was experiencing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.98,0:14:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,体验了男性和女性的高潮\N{\fnArial\fs30}male and female orgasms at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.15,0:14:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 天啊 天啊 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my… - Oh, my… Oh, my God. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.88,0:14:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.72,0:14:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是让我停不下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get enough of your…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.15,0:14:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.42,0:14:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 道森过得很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry? - Dawson's having a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.87,0:14:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定会有个「但是」\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be a "But."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.75,0:14:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他过得很开心 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's having a great time, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.08,0:14:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.67,0:14:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让一让 让一让\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming through. Coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.77,0:14:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快 - 快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.42,0:14:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天 惠特利参议员被紧急送来医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day, they rush in Senator Whitley.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.26,0:14:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在一个慈善晚会上晕倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd collapsed at some fundraiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.82,0:14:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人查得出来他怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one could tell what in hell was wrong with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.50,0:15:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抬 - 交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lift. - I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.62,0:15:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,道森接手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawson's hooked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.01,0:15:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心点 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Be careful. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.30,0:15:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天呐 - 这让他极其痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jeez. - And has the roughest ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.51,0:15:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 彼得 - 他好像完全不知道是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pete? - Like he's got no clue what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 彼得 - 再给我一分钟 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pete? - Just one more minute, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.50,0:15:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the man work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.46,0:15:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一种他从未体验过的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pain he's never known.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.89,0:15:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 彼得 他没心跳了 - 再给我一分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pete, he's flatlining. - Just one more moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.20,0:15:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就那样发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.86,0:15:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.18,0:15:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,道森昏迷了大概五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawson blacked out, for, like, five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.93,0:15:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个参议员是被人下毒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out the senator had been poisoned,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.87,0:15:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种罕见的俄罗斯毒药\N{\fnArial\fs30}a rare poison at that, some kind of Russian shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.28,0:15:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他自己造的孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd been into that whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是道森体验了死亡 并回到了人世\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Dawson had experienced death and come out the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.68,0:15:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡来临的一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the moment of death,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.84,0:15:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,大量突触感应瞬间消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}a whole galaxy of synapses fritzes out of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.93,0:16:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,内啡肽排山倒海\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tsunami of endorphins.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后紧接着涌来一阵虚无的暗潮\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then there's this rolling dark wave of nothing rushes in behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.09,0:16:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他醒过来 他们对他做了各种检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he came round, they ran every kind of test.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的系统一切正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he was all systems go, nothing wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.30,0:16:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告上写的是 「受惊 但未受伤」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Shaken but unharmed, " They put on his report.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.64,0:16:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二天 他又继续开工了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next day, he was back up and at 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.50,0:16:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有些不对劲 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there was something wrong, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.15,0:16:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼门关走一遭回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}To go through all that without dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.91,0:16:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞坏了他的植入物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucked up his implant like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.39,0:16:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.02,0:16:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去拿点水 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm just gonna get some water. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.41,0:16:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.15,0:16:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以说他和痛苦的关系有所变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair to say his relationship with pain had shifted a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.43,0:16:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,疼死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hurt like hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.96,0:16:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他喜欢上它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, he was into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.55,0:17:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那之后 他把精力全都投入到了工作上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He really threw himself into his work after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.90,0:17:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一开始想隐瞒 但是由于那个小接收器\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to hide it at first, but thanks to that little nubbin,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.71,0:17:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他越是痛苦 就越是愉悦\N{\fnArial\fs30}the more pain he felt, the more pleasure he got.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, no. Stop, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.25,0:17:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下 安全词 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop. OK, safe word. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.55,0:17:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说了我们可以试试 - 我们试了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You said that we could try it. - And we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.46,0:17:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们试了拉头发和口球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we tried the hair pulling and that choke thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.86,0:17:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢 这不适合我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not into it, OK? It's just not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.19,0:17:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.61,0:17:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.42,0:17:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.45,0:17:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下来 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay. Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.80,0:18:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.37,0:18:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.96,0:18:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 就像吃辣椒\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, it's like eating chilies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.20,0:18:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会适应得很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}You acclimatize fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.98,0:18:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你第一次吃墨西哥辣椒肯定马上吐掉 太辣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time you had a jalapeno, bet you spat it out, too hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.45,0:18:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但坚持下来就会上瘾\N{\fnArial\fs30}But persevere and it becomes addictive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.63,0:18:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快 一个墨西哥辣椒已经不够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon, a jalapeno's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.76,0:18:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你追求越来越高 红辣椒 鸟眼辣椒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You work your way up, red-hot chilies, bird's-eye chilies,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.13,0:18:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直到苏格兰魔鬼椒\N{\fnArial\fs30}till you get to them Scotch bonnet devils.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.22,0:18:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,道森的渴望也是一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawson's craving was just the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.42,0:18:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知不觉 他开始经常去急诊室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you know it, he's hanging around the ER.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.60,0:18:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,想等下一个事故受害者再给他这种体验\N{\fnArial\fs30}just waiting for a juicy accident victim to latch onto.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.97,0:18:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他满脑子只有对下一次痛感的期待\N{\fnArial\fs30}All he can think about is that next hit gnawing away up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.67,0:18:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,「再给我 再给我 再给我」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Give it back to me. Give it back. I gotta have it back."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.89,0:18:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉 你能帮我提交这些吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah, will you just, um, file these for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.91,0:18:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure thing. - Pete.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.26,0:18:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在不是你当班 - 带他去四号床\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This isn't your shift. - Take him round to bay four.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.79,0:18:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK. - I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.45,0:18:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.61,0:19:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.93,0:19:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}And three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.24,0:19:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,抬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.21,0:19:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.15,0:19:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一戴上 就感觉到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon as he jacks in, he feels it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.74,0:19:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是心脏病 她在街上晕倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a cardiac arrest. She collapsed in the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.31,0:19:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想确定一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.60,0:19:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确是心脏病 但他什么都没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a heart attack all right, but he says nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.35,0:19:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plays for time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.12,0:19:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为他能乘着痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figures he can ride that pain train.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.21,0:19:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,享受极乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the way through to nirvana.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.72,0:19:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后他们只能强行把道森从她身边拉开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eventually they have to physically pull Dawson away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.17,0:19:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,给艾瑟尔婆婆做心肺复苏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give Aunt Ethel her CPR.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.58,0:19:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在他面前死去 他却像个酒鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}She flatlines in front of him, and he's like an alcoholic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.03,0:19:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着一杯上好的威士忌被倒进水池里\N{\fnArial\fs30}watching someone pour a glass of good Scotch down the sink,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.83,0:19:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,因好东西被浪费而难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}sick at the waste of good shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.36,0:20:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直都清楚 这可能会有副作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we always knew going into this there might be side effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.00,0:20:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以研究一下如何停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we can look into how we deactivate,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.40,0:20:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但需要时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's gonna take some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.14,0:20:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能从其他项目撤人出来 彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't just pull all the people off the other projects, Pete.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.15,0:20:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有目标要实现 这你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we have milestones to hit. You know the drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.35,0:20:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们会成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we'll get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.80,0:20:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此期间 我们不能让你靠近病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the meantime, we can't have you near patients,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.14,0:20:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so just go home,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.13,0:20:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息一下 连刷一整部迷你剧什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}put your feet up and binge a miniseries, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.77,0:20:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能料到接下来会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one could have known what'd happen next.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.43,0:20:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有关部门将确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Authorities are expected to confirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.30,0:20:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体是失踪的WNL天气预报员丹妮斯·斯托克利\N{\fnArial\fs30}the body is that of missing WNL weather reporter Denise Stockley.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.60,0:20:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以看见 大量警力聚集在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly a major police presence there, as we can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.88,0:20:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来看看时间线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take a look at the timeline…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.59,0:20:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,道森整天都独自在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawson was home alone 24/7,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.20,0:20:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,烦躁不安 大概是戒断反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}climbing the walls. Withdrawal, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.35,0:20:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们最后一次见到她是9月15日周五晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was last seen the evening of Friday, September 15th…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.72,0:21:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再有病人供他榨取痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't have patients to leech pain off anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.06,0:21:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他开始给自己施加痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he started inflicting it… on himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.40,0:21:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能让她安全归来\N{\fnArial\fs30}For her safe return,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.46,0:21:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是有目击者提供任何相关信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}or for any information from witnesses…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.10,0:21:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,整整一周他都在自残\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spent a week just whittling away at himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.99,0:21:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里切切 那里凿凿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut here, a gouge there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.86,0:21:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他毕竟是医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the guy was a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.28,0:21:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道最多可以切到什么程度而不会丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew how far he could go without it getting fatal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.72,0:22:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但永远不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was never enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.73,0:22:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论怎么做都不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of it was enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.53,0:22:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自残的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he worked on himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.80,0:22:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,少了一样至关重要的因素\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was a crucial ingredient missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.13,0:22:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.19,0:22:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,杏仁核\N{\fnArial\fs30}The amygdala.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.55,0:22:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑中杏仁状的小核\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little almond-shaped nubbin in your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.60,0:22:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害怕的时候 它会活跃起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're afraid, it lights up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.20,0:22:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像午夜空袭 让感觉变灵敏\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a midnight airstrike, sharpens the senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.93,0:22:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,病人盯着顶灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fear the patient feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.84,0:22:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,所感觉到的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}when they're staring up at that ceiling light,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.14,0:22:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,伴随冷不丁刺一下的痛苦而来的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}the fear accompanying each sudden jab of agony,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.86,0:22:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他渐渐也喜欢上了那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'd come to appreciate that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.12,0:22:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,它和痛苦如影随形\N{\fnArial\fs30}It went with the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.92,0:22:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是痛苦的补充 就像红酒和牛排\N{\fnArial\fs30}Complemented it, like red wine and steak.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.85,0:22:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以给自己施加痛苦 但恐惧没法只靠自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can inflict pain on yourself, but not terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.46,0:22:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,要想得到恐惧 需要一个志愿者\N{\fnArial\fs30}For that, you need a volunteer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.72,0:24:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们找到道森的时候 他正在高潮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawson was practically coming when they found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.56,0:24:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,享受着恐惧 痛苦和死亡的混合毒品\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd enjoyed one big old speedball of fear and pain and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.69,0:24:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把他关进监狱了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me they put him in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.11,0:24:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,送进了医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.24,0:24:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他成了植物人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wound up in a vegetative state.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.14,0:24:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.33,0:24:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到今天还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still there to this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.58,0:24:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,陷入了深海一般的昏迷中\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a coma, deep as the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.15,0:24:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the thing of it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.73,0:24:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们说 他脸上还是那个表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}they say he still has that look on his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.58,0:24:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸福满溢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blissed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.33,0:24:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,依然沉醉在高潮里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still riding that high.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.44,0:24:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在逗我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're fucking with me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.95,0:24:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 擎天柱是我编的 忍不住\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, I added the boner. I couldn't resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.47,0:24:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很有意思吧 - 是有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fun story, huh? - Yep, fun story.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.38,0:25:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.64,0:25:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,想喝水吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want some water?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.82,0:25:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不用了 - 没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really, I'm fine. - No, man, it's no bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.14,0:25:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you kindly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.64,0:25:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么没继续干医疗科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how come you didn't stay in med tech?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.56,0:25:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又干了一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I did for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.87,0:25:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能因为道森成了植物人 就停止神经研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just 'cause Dawson went la-la, neuro research didn't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.95,0:25:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,TCKR对它进行了改进和微调\N{\fnArial\fs30}TCKR adapted it and fine-tuned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.27,0:25:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,数码意识传输\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's how they wound up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.10,0:25:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样创造出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the digital consciousness transference,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.73,0:25:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在叫意识存储器了\N{\fnArial\fs30}what they call cookies today.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.94,0:25:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像他们把老人上传到云端\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, like when they upload old people to the cloud?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.94,0:25:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但这比那项技术早多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but this was way before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.70,0:25:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时没有完备的浸入式虚拟现实环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't have that whole immersive VR environment shizzle back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.24,0:25:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们更多是在生物层面上的 低保真\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we dealt with was more organic, almost lo-fi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.80,0:25:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.50,0:26:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问的问题比普通人多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta say you ask more questions than the average bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.36,0:26:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 我的车还在充电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, to be honest, my car's still charging,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.29,0:26:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我有时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I've got a bit of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.05,0:26:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我想给你展示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, what I wanted to show you, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.99,0:26:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时研究的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part of what I was working on…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.15,0:26:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,还挺…可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, um… cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.44,0:26:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是本馆最悲哀的东西之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, one of the saddest things in the whole place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.02,0:26:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着可不像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't look it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.23,0:26:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有经历过这样一段感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever had one of those relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.57,0:26:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完全没法把那人从脑海里赶走\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you just can't get someone out of your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.30,0:26:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有过 - 数年前 男孩遇见了女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Some years back, boy meets girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.08,0:26:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,男孩叫杰克 女孩叫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy's called Jack, girl's called…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.49,0:26:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吉尔 - 凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jill. - Carrie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.71,0:26:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃纸杯蛋糕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cupcake?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.67,0:26:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.05,0:27:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你现在是警长了 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you the sheriff now? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.47,0:27:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是囚犯 - 你有麻烦了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I'm the prisoner? - You're in trouble, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.38,0:27:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,来抓我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and arrest me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.88,0:27:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后 他的屌往她的屁股里吐了黏糊糊的种子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eventually, he dick-pukes a little baby paste up her wazoo,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.96,0:27:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,种子生根了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which takes hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.47,0:27:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没回过神 就冒出一个男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you know it, out pops a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.54,0:27:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parker.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.51,0:27:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 他们组成了一个家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom. They're a family unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.68,0:27:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸福美满 其乐融融\N{\fnArial\fs30}A walking commercial for a sunnier future. Happy as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.38,0:27:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想给你们拍张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna… I wanna take a photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.51,0:27:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把背景的湖也拍进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. I'm gonna get the lake in the background.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.27,0:27:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来 伙计 - 准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, buddy. - OK, you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.47,0:27:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parker.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.46,0:27:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,和妈妈招手 和妈妈打个招呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wave to Mommy. Say hello. Say hi to Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.71,0:27:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉被卡车撞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carrie gets hit by a truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.45,0:27:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,躺在了圣朱尼佩医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winds up at St. Juniper's.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.16,0:28:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到我身边吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.00,0:28:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.26,0:28:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Years go by.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.97,0:28:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克每周都来看她 和她说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack visits her every week, talks to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.87,0:28:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,放他们儿子的录音 东扯西扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}plays her recordings of their son, shoots the shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.42,0:28:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一直没醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}She never wakes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.65,0:28:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们给她装了台通讯盒子做测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they tested the comm box on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.15,0:28:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种帮助昏迷病人做出简单回应的基础装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}A kind of basic device that let coma folks sort of respond back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.89,0:28:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带了些清新剂 你想要松林味的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you some room fresheners. You want pine forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.85,0:28:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.17,0:28:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,柑橘味呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about citrus fresh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.43,0:28:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好嘞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.10,0:28:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还录了帕克和别的孩子一起唱的歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I recorded Parker singing with some other kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.50,0:28:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想听吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.91,0:28:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,*一闪一闪亮晶晶*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Twinkle, twinkle, little star*
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.54,0:29:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,*满天都是小星星*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*How I wonder what you are*
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.23,0:29:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,302房的女人 凯莉·拉曼斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The woman in 302, Carrie Lamasse.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.91,0:29:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是她的伴侣 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the partner, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.40,0:29:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.64,0:29:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是罗洛·海恩斯 TCKR神经研发部代表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rolo Haynes. I represent neuro R&D for TCKR.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.15,0:29:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.03,0:29:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在研究一个项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're working on a project that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.04,0:29:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许会对你这种情况的人有所帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}might be of interest to someone in your position.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.04,0:29:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's… What's my position?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.31,0:29:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正探索的项目 可以给凯莉这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're exploring something that could give the likes of Carrie.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.18,0:29:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,带来新生\N{\fnArial\fs30}a whole new lease of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.28,0:29:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking miraculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.29,0:29:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.85,0:29:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,TCKR的人一直在研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the guys at TCKR have been working.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.40,0:29:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,将一个大脑里的意识数字化地抽取出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}on digitally extracting a consciousness out of one brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.52,0:29:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,再安置到宿主大脑中去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and kind of rehousing it in a host brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.70,0:29:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么意思 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What does that even mean? - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.81,0:29:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们平时最多只会用大脑容量的40%\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, even on a good day, we only use 40% of our brain capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.55,0:29:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下60%的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is this whole other 60% of our noggin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.72,0:29:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像空房间一样 没有利用起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}hanging around like an empty Airbnb.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.81,0:29:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so…?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.80,0:29:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以有了我们的「压缩」技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so with our new compression technique,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.79,0:30:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就可以将另一个意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}we figure we can fit another whole consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.93,0:30:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,移植到大脑没利用到的空间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}into that unused space.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.87,0:30:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.24,0:30:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把凯莉的意识从那具破损的躯壳取出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carrie's consciousness from that broken shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.56,0:30:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,放到那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and putting it in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.39,0:30:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 她的声音会在我脑子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Um… Like a voice inside my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.13,0:30:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她整个人都在你脑子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the whole of her inside your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.31,0:30:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,类似她成了乘客 搭了你的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a hitchhiker. Like a passenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.75,0:30:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会有间接感知 她能看到你所看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vicarious sensations. She sees what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.79,0:30:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,感受你所感受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She feels what you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.55,0:30:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可以获得新生\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can live again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.77,0:30:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「感受」… - 你们有个儿子 帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Feels" as in…? - You got a little boy. Parker.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.05,0:30:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.99,0:30:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拥抱帕克 凯莉也会感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hug Parker and Carrie feels it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.87,0:30:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可以通过你拥抱你们的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can hug your son via you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.06,0:30:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要花多少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much does this all cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.04,0:30:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一分钱也不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't cost a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.64,0:30:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在移植过程中\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will have to euthanize.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.04,0:30:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须将她的躯体安乐死\N{\fnArial\fs30}her physical body during the transfer process,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.35,0:30:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们会保留她的器官用于捐献移植\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we would earmark her organs for transplants.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.74,0:31:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,为社会做些贡献\N{\fnArial\fs30}Giving back to the community.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.32,0:31:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你意下如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.29,0:31:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.25,0:31:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉已经想好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carrie's done her thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.23,0:31:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.29,0:31:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始「上传」程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commencing upload procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.72,0:31:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始「下载」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now moving to download.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.82,0:31:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 她「安装」好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, she's installed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.36,0:31:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.63,0:32:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以睁开眼睛了 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can open your eyes now, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.81,0:32:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carrie?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.21,0:32:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能听到的话 告诉杰克你看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can hear me, tell Jack what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.27,0:32:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个苹果 我看到一个苹果\N{\fnArial\fs30}An… An apple. I… I see an apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.37,0:32:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能听见她说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hear her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.03,0:32:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,苹果 苹果 她说看到了苹果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apple. Apple. She's saying apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.05,0:32:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.92,0:32:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.47,0:32:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.01,0:32:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,握住它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grip it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.77,0:32:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉 能感觉到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carrie, you feel that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.49,0:33:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说能感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says she feels it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.48,0:33:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,感官正常 咬一口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sensations looking good. Take a bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.42,0:33:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.77,0:33:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好久没尝到食物的味道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So long since I tasted anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.05,0:33:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能尝到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can taste that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.71,0:33:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她尝到了 我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}She tastes it. Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.28,0:33:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来一切顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you're all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.96,0:33:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以把他带进来了 - 来吧 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shall we bring him in? - Come on in, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.13,0:33:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是帕克吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that Parker?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.18,0:33:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他长这么大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.22,0:33:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 抱住他 抱抱我们的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, Jack, hold him. Hold our little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.80,0:33:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我个大大的拥抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a really big hug, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.69,0:33:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉到 我能感觉到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel him. I really feel him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.50,0:33:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪说她爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy says she loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.71,0:34:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很暖心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truly heartwarming.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.49,0:34:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但总是有个「但是」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. But this is where you say "But."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.18,0:34:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然不想深挖哲学 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not to wax philosophical, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.07,0:34:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸福感到底可以持续多久呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}how long can happiness realistically last anyhow?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.41,0:34:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快翻页啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn the page already.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.16,0:34:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你阅读速度真慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you read slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.84,0:34:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢细细品味图片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like to take in the pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.50,0:34:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是绘本的绘画部分所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what the graphic part of a graphic novel is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.96,0:34:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.25,0:34:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去趟厕所\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta take a piss.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.07,0:34:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不会习惯这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never get used to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.44,0:34:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是感觉很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.72,0:35:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不给我们洗手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not washing our hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.89,0:35:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.33,0:35:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 有点恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, though, it's kind of gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.61,0:35:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 38岁的克莱顿·雷因残忍杀害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}38-year-old Clayton Leigh was today found guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.75,0:35:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,WNL天气预报员丹妮斯·斯托克利被定罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the horrific murder of WNL weather reporter Denise Stockley,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.51,0:35:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的残尸在一年前的今天被发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose mutilated remains were discovered one year ago today.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.92,0:35:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该关掉这个 对4岁孩子来说太血腥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should turn this off. It's disturbing to a four-year-old.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.47,0:35:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 他都没在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's fine. He's not even listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.64,0:35:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克 老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parker! Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.53,0:35:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别对他发火 - 冲我发火就可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't snap at him. - But snapping at me is fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.24,0:35:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的 - 这样如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Baby, you're… - How does that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.55,0:35:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.52,0:35:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很严重 怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is serious, man. Wha…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.38,0:35:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我没有 我没有不讲理\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I'm not being… I'm not being unreasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.35,0:35:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等等 不 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, just wait. No. Just… Just hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.49,0:35:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个永远不离开的后座司机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having a back-seat driver glued into the back seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.23,0:35:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对车里的人来说可不怎么好受\N{\fnArial\fs30}ain't no fun for anyone in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.15,0:36:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有隐私 她无法行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}No privacy for him. No agency for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.93,0:36:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这会让你发疯的 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It'd drive you mental. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.81,0:36:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 当我没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, fine, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.58,0:36:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 继续 继续说\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, go ahead. Keep talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.97,0:36:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要吃凤尾鱼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going for the anchovies.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.27,0:36:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能保持安静吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna be quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.68,0:36:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在想闭嘴了吗 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna shut up now? You're good?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.22,0:36:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.99,0:36:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.12,0:36:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.47,0:36:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I don't… I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.47,0:36:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… you're still talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.27,0:36:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.38,0:36:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyhow,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.12,0:36:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他或他们不久后就来找我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}soon he or they come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.84,0:36:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我是他们的情感治疗师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I'm their relationship therapist.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.74,0:36:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能消停一下让我说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you pipe down and let me speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.26,0:36:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我起码说完一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me finish a goddamn sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.21,0:36:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道问题所在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I see the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.35,0:36:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她才是问题所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.55,0:36:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲不敬 熟生蔑就是问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Familiarity breeding contempt is the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.36,0:36:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们需要限制联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to ration your contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.58,0:36:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么限制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ration how?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.43,0:36:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在我的脑子里就像一支忘不掉的曲子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's running through my head like a goddamn tune I can't shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.94,0:36:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以升级你的权限 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we could upgrade your privileges, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.46,0:37:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你更多控制权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give you a little more control.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.25,0:37:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 抱歉 继续说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! Sorry. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.78,0:37:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe if you had the ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.92,0:37:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,时不时暂停凯莉的感知\N{\fnArial\fs30}to place Carrie on pause now and then…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.60,0:37:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你们俩来说都会好些\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'd make things easier for the both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.84,0:37:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.12,0:37:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不管呢 就这么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever. Whatever. Whatever. Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.38,0:37:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他升级了他的权限\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he upped his privileges.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.01,0:37:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在可以暂停她了 - 这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Should be able to put her on pause. - This one?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.79,0:37:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.11,0:37:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没过多久就开始使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't take him long to use 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.79,0:37:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们现在堂而皇之地看辣妹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now we're just openly checking out women's racks?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.04,0:37:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't say you weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.34,0:37:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我能感觉你硬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I can feel the fucking boner forming, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.66,0:38:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她离开时还盯着人家的屁股 妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he checks her ass too as she leaves. Holy fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.85,0:38:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就打量她了 怎么着\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I checked her out. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.33,0:38:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都憋死了 已经快一个月没撸过一发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm horny as fuck, haven't jerked off in, like, a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.51,0:38:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没阻止你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not stopping you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.44,0:38:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我脑袋里一直盯着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking over my shoulder but from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.95,0:38:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是在一个警察面前撸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like trying to jerk off in front of a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.60,0:38:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这警察还是你妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's also your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.97,0:38:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去你的 - 好吧 告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck you! - OK, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.91,0:38:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. That's it. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.09,0:38:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 我要暂停你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time out. I'm putting you on pause.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.59,0:38:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 杰克 你敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Jack, don't you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.92,0:38:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 杰克 我警告你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack. Jack, I'm warning you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.79,0:38:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.20,0:38:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.29,0:38:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到家了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are… Are we at home?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.25,0:38:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么有万圣节南瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the Halloween pumpkin?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.19,0:38:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,万圣节离现在还有几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Halloween's months from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.34,0:38:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 就是今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it's today.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.83,0:38:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被暂停了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long was I on pause?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.49,0:38:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就几周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a few weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.46,0:39:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不清楚 八周\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Eight?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.22,0:39:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, I know. I'm… I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.77,0:39:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 抱歉 我也过意不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I'm sorry. I felt really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.64,0:39:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我给你买了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, um, I got you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.25,0:39:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天算是我们的纪念日 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figured it's kind of our anniversary, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.94,0:39:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的 你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you. You're a fucking asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.51,0:39:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要不要我吃这个纸杯蛋糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to eat this cupcake or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.89,0:39:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,橙味奶油糖霜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orange cream icing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.77,0:39:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帕克在哪里 - 这可是你的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Parker? - Your favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.94,0:39:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想见帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna see Parker.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.23,0:39:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我几个月没见到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had him away from me for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.27,0:39:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想见我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna see my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.09,0:39:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.05,0:39:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.01,0:39:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.29,0:39:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在忙什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got going on there?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.47,0:39:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是辆消防车吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that a fire truck? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.48,0:39:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他我爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him I love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.82,0:40:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 妈妈爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy, Mommy loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.80,0:40:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.40,0:40:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他我需要一个拥抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him I need a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.73,0:40:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.30,0:40:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈想要抱抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy needs a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.20,0:40:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.58,0:40:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克让事情复杂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parker complicated things.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.22,0:40:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都觉得要为他负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}They both felt responsibility for him,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.58,0:40:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们想要各退一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they tried to compromise,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.26,0:40:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,达成共识 像大人那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, reach an agreement, like adults.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.11,0:40:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在平时 杰克都把凯莉暂停 而到了周末\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack put Carrie on pause except for the weekends,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.99,0:40:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会带着凯莉跟帕克出去玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}when they'd take Parker out with Carrie in attendance,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.49,0:40:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点像拥有探视权的离婚夫妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}kind of like a divorcee with visiting rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.81,0:40:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去藏起来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.82,0:40:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.81,0:40:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,被你骗到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tricked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.66,0:41:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.66,0:41:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.26,0:41:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个办法还行\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.21,0:41:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,维持了一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.29,0:41:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们是邻居\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we're neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.23,0:41:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚搬进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just moved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.94,0:41:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾米丽 - 杰克 很高兴认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Emily. - Jack. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.93,0:41:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.87,0:41:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是谁 - 他叫帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's this? - It's Parker.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.58,0:41:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好酷的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool name.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.36,0:41:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I'll see you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.53,0:41:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.59,0:41:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I'll see you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.45,0:41:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是表示友好 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was nice, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.72,0:41:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,别狡辩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut the shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.17,0:41:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你都精虫上脑了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know when your hormones are flowing, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.51,0:41:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们讲话的同时 我们的蛋蛋都涨大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our balls are brewing up a blow load as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.60,0:41:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在别闹 我们的儿子还在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. I'm with our son.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.43,0:42:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没泡过谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't hit on anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.67,0:42:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 算了 探视时间结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Fuck it. Visiting time is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.96,0:42:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 杰克 你敢 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Jack, don't you dare. Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.72,0:42:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 你这个婊子养…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, you son of a bi…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.49,0:42:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parker, wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.93,0:42:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 渐渐地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyhow, as time passed by,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.01,0:42:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克跟邻居好上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack got it on with the neighbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.24,0:42:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,而凯莉对此并不开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Carrie didn't take it so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.62,0:42:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,她平日都要工作 我们只是想一起过个周末\N{\fnArial\fs30}She works all week. We just wanted to spend a weekend together.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.38,0:42:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 你就不能为我们感到高兴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, can't you just be happy for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.43,0:42:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 杰克 很奇怪 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Jack, weirdly enough, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.29,0:42:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 你真刻薄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ, you are so bitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.71,0:42:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.36,0:42:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在为难你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she giving you shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.50,0:42:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉 别为难他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carrie, stop giving him shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.94,0:42:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her to back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.66,0:42:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我… - 告诉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I… - Tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.33,0:42:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.62,0:42:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以周末的办法不管用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the weekend thing isn't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.06,0:43:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们试过限制她到一小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we tried limiting her to an hour…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.84,0:43:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道她就在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can tell that she's in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.33,0:43:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不断地挑刺和说坏话\N{\fnArial\fs30}like that judging and bitching.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.80,0:43:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间限制让凯莉很苦恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time frame is frustrating for Carrie.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.07,0:43:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉让我们很苦恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carrie is frustrating for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.84,0:43:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在把凯莉暂停了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got Carrie on pause now?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.64,0:43:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.93,0:43:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是可以把她删除的\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's always deletion.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.99,0:43:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是说… - 将她永久抹去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- As in…? - As in permanent erasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.16,0:43:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.54,0:43:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是杀死她\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'd… That'd be killing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.81,0:43:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,在法律上不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not legally.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.92,0:43:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但道德上是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But ethically.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.22,0:43:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 她只是你大脑中残存的代码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. She is just some leftover code in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.39,0:43:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就像删除一封邮件一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be like… like deleting an email.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.50,0:43:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.40,0:43:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不能删除 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No deletion. I'm not doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.66,0:43:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想陪伴帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants to be near Parker.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.77,0:43:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能剥夺她的这个权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't take that away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.61,0:43:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定还有办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be something you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.40,0:43:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friends…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.02,0:43:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们运气不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're in luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.15,0:44:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在对这个产品进行封闭测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's something we're beta testing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.31,0:44:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标用户其实是重病晚期的父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's actually aimed at terminally ill parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.69,0:44:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点像给他们孩子的纪念品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of like a souvenir for their kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.33,0:44:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.34,0:44:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只猴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.88,0:44:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,更像是一个留念\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like a keepsake.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.13,0:44:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以把她放进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can put her in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.49,0:44:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,放到那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In there?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.37,0:44:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有个意识接收器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's… It has a consciousness receptor,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.80,0:44:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点像我们放进你大脑里的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}kind of like the one we put in your head,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.43,0:44:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过它是个原型机\N{\fnArial\fs30}but a prototype.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.66,0:44:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有个摄像头 所以她能看见帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's a camera here so she can see Parker.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.64,0:44:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 整个身体具有触觉反馈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus the whole body's got haptic feedback,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.73,0:44:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果小帕克给它一个拥抱 她会感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}so if little Parkie gives it a cuddle, she'll feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.34,0:44:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且她也能进行反馈\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she can communicate back,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.39,0:44:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但用一种小孩子喜欢的受限方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}but in a kid-friendly, controlled way.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.49,0:44:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我得想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't know. I'm gonna have to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.34,0:44:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.69,0:44:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经想好了 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she's done her thinking. How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.40,0:44:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,转移进行得很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}The transfer went pretty fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.70,0:45:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉完全不知道这件事正在发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carrie wouldn't have even been aware it was happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.70,0:45:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到她醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till she woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.02,0:45:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 你得把它撕开 撕开包裹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, buddy, you gotta tear it. Tear into that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.49,0:45:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克 - 你差不多搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jack? - You almost got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.44,0:45:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.21,0:45:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 把它拿出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, pull it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.44,0:45:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.76,0:45:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么 帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, Parker?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.39,0:45:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,小猴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.82,0:45:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.85,0:45:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's pretty cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.11,0:45:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 杰克 这怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack. Jack, what the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.05,0:45:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know something?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.30,0:45:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This… This, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.99,0:45:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是只很特别的小猴\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a very special monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.92,0:45:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是妈妈给你的 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom wanted you to have it. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.58,0:45:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次你拥抱它 妈妈就会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time you hug it, Mom will know,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.26,0:45:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也能感觉到那个拥抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she'll feel that hug too.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.25,0:45:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 杰克 把我放回你的脑袋里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no, Jack, Jack, put me back in your fucking head.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.86,0:45:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.98,0:45:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只小猴还可以和你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this monkey can speak to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.21,0:45:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以让你知道它的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can let you know how it feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.08,0:46:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did she speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.46,0:46:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,语音设置是比较原始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the comm setup was a little rudimentary.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.76,0:46:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个原型机嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this is a prototype.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.27,0:46:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.44,0:46:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.77,0:46:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,小猴爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkey loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.41,0:46:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.82,0:46:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,小猴想要抱抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkey needs a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.01,0:46:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,给小猴一个抱抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give monkey a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.11,0:46:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,小猴爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkey loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.34,0:46:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,小猴想要抱抱 小猴爱你 小猴爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkey needs a hug. Monkey loves you. Monkey loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.40,0:46:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,小猴爱你 小猴 小猴想要抱抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkey loves you. Monkey… Monkey… Monkey needs a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.97,0:46:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得 - 小猴爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I think… - Monkey loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.85,0:46:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,小猴 小猴想要抱抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkey… Monkey needs a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.85,0:46:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,小猴需要点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkey just needs a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.57,0:46:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,适应自己的新环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get used to how things are gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.81,0:47:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你个臭婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, listen, you fucking bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.01,0:47:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们依然可以删除你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can still have you wiped.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.62,0:47:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是想这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.07,0:47:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,用「小猴想要抱抱」表示「不」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do "Monkey needs a hug" for no.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.29,0:47:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,小猴想要抱抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkey needs a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.94,0:47:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能做个好玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna be a good toy?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.63,0:47:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能做个好玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna be a good toy?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.23,0:47:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,小猴爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkey loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.08,0:47:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那最好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.08,0:47:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 最终\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyhow, in the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.76,0:47:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克厌烦了他的新玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parker got tired of his new toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.97,0:47:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.27,0:47:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不知感恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're ingrates.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.87,0:48:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,小猴需要抱抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkey needs a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.38,0:48:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 这是个犯罪博物馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, so this is a crime museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.74,0:48:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的罪何在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the crime in this?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.89,0:48:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,小猴就是罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the monkey is the crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.49,0:48:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, a couple of years back,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.84,0:48:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,联合国认定将人类意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}the UN made it illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.11,0:48:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,上传到这样的有限制载体上是非法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to transfer human consciousnesses into limited formats like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.31,0:48:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,载体得至少能表现出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta be able to express at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.26,0:48:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类的五种情感 这样才人道\N{\fnArial\fs30}five emotions for it to be humane, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.58,0:48:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,意识存储器也得讲人权 对吧 凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human rights for cookies. Right, Carrie?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.64,0:48:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,小猴需要抱抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkey needs a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.38,0:48:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还在里面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's still in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.54,0:48:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,删除她也是不合法的 所以 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be illegal to delete her too, so, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.32,0:48:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.66,0:48:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 美国公民自由联盟开始声讨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyhow, ACLU raised one heck of a stink,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.13,0:48:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢这只臭猴子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and so thanks to this son of a monkey,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.72,0:48:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被踢出了TCKR\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was out on my ass from TCKR.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.58,0:48:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,连遣散费都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even a severance package.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.08,0:48:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我建立这个地方的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's why I started this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.96,0:48:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得另辟蹊径\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had to branch out somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.91,0:48:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我猜它正符合我的趣味\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it appealed to the carny in me, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.19,0:49:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,小猴需要抱抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkey needs a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.69,0:49:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,空调还不好使 真热\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn AC's still not working. it's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.99,0:49:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我已经让你等太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've kept you waiting too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.09,0:49:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好看主展品了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready for the prime exhibit?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.73,0:49:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.57,0:49:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我得警告你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I gotta warn you,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.61,0:49:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是曾经的样子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's not the man he once… was.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.90,0:49:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 你还需要水吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. - Do you want some more water?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.75,0:49:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.26,0:49:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.96,0:49:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 你有个访客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, mister! You got a visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.45,0:49:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是克莱顿·雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I present Clayton Leigh,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.14,0:49:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,天气预报员杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}weather girl killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.05,0:49:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 他现在都闷闷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, he's kind of mopey these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.91,0:49:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去怪可怜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cuts kind of a pathetic figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.02,0:50:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但别太为他感到抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't feel too sorry for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.07,0:50:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个被判有罪的杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a convicted murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.44,0:50:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可别忘了丹妮斯·斯托克利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lest we forget Denise Stockley.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.57,0:50:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜可爱的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tragic and cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.55,0:50:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是啊 克莱顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't that right, Clayton?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.78,0:50:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他其实在看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's actually looking at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.63,0:50:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 可能他喜欢你这型的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out. Maybe you're his type.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.86,0:50:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看上去好真实\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looks so real.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.43,0:50:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是他 或者说是他完整的上传意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it is him, or a fully conscious upload of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.58,0:50:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能在想他是怎么进去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're probably wondering how he got in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.97,0:50:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,TCKR把我开除后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After TCKR kicked me out,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.91,0:50:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的计划原本是做名人意识这一块\N{\fnArial\fs30}my plan was to branch out into celebrity consciousnesses,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.50,0:50:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,征求名人的同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}sign up famous people and.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.81,0:50:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们在死后能以全息影像的方式重生\N{\fnArial\fs30}reincarnate them as holograms after they die.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.13,0:50:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点像活人版杜莎夫人蜡像馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of like a living Madame Tussauds.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.99,0:50:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但名人麻烦多\N{\fnArial\fs30}But celebrities, that's just a quagmire.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.17,0:50:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多版权问题 混蛋代理人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many rights issues, asshole representatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.08,0:51:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但被判有罪的杀人犯呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But convicted killers?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.54,0:51:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是另一回事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a different story.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.70,0:51:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷先生 请允许我自我介绍一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Leigh, allow me to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.95,0:51:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫罗洛·海恩斯 - 听说你是搞科技的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My name is Rolo Haynes. - They say you're in technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.87,0:51:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 那你能帮我查查DNA的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, yes, that is true. - So you can look into this DNA thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.16,0:51:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove it wasn't me?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.45,0:51:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 这当然有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, yes, that's certainly a possibility,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.11,0:51:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这不是我来的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that's not why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.69,0:51:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有一个提议 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have a proposal. - Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.99,0:51:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我有一个提议 我能帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait. I have a proposal. I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.58,0:51:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮你的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.03,0:51:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么说服他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you talk him into it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.75,0:52:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没怎么费力就说服了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't need much convincing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.05,0:52:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是万一发生最坏的情况 将你的数字自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So really it's just signing over the rights to your digital self.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.05,0:52:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,转让给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}in case the worst happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.86,0:52:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证你的亲属\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I promise your relatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.75,0:52:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会获得大笔利润\N{\fnArial\fs30}will receive the lion's share of any profits.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.85,0:52:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 如果 万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if, you know, God forbid,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.16,0:52:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被送上电椅\N{\fnArial\fs30}you do get sent to the chair,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.79,0:52:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你的家人将一辈子衣食无忧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know your family will be provided for, for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.32,0:52:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的家人觉得如何 - 他们完全不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How'd his family feel about it? - They didn't give a shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.70,0:52:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他被抓后就不管他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abandoned him the moment he got locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.62,0:52:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.45,0:52:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 克莱 这是你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ, Clay, it's your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.14,0:52:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,才没有那种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't no such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.56,0:52:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是电脑模拟出来的什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a computer simulation or somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.01,0:52:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他为什么需要你的许可\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why does he need your permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.95,0:52:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能获得特赦 那就无所谓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my pardon comes through, it won't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.22,0:52:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it doesn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.32,0:52:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们让我上电椅 你们能得到钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then if they send me to the chair, this is gonna pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.29,0:52:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让你和孩子们有钱生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna keep you and the kids above water,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.72,0:53:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会流落街头\N{\fnArial\fs30}maintain a roof over y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.82,0:53:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.37,0:53:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能是件好事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could be a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.36,0:53:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他没有等来赦免\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he never did get that pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.44,0:53:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不会 因为他有罪嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, no, 'cause he was guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.11,0:53:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是有些疑点吗 你知道那个纪录片吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But wasn't there some doubt? You know, that documentary?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.80,0:53:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,假新闻 都是诽谤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fake news. Hatchet job.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.01,0:53:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那篡改DNA呢 - 你不是认真的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about the DNA tampering? - Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.26,0:53:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那件案子没有任何疑点\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.89,0:53:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他上电椅的那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day he got the chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.32,0:53:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是正义胜利的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}was a great day for justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.73,0:53:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱顿无法抱怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clayton couldn't complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.44,0:53:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可是会成为一个先驱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he was gonna be a pioneer.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.94,0:53:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要抽取他全部的意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna slurp up his entire consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.91,0:53:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将是第一个从死刑中存活的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd be the first guy on death row to survive his own execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.21,0:54:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,转移进行得很顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}The transfer went beautifully.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.11,0:54:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快 克莱顿就重生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I knew it, Clayton was born again.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.01,0:55:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.61,0:55:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝贺你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.99,0:55:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以说已经进入来世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in the afterlife, so to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.73,0:55:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.43,0:55:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个幽灵吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.80,0:55:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你觉得是就是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that helps, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.12,0:55:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要进行一些测试 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just gotta test a few things here, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.31,0:55:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这看上去可能有点怪 在那里先别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this may seem a little weird. Just hang on in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.55,0:55:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.63,0:55:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道光是看那家伙困在里面团团转\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I knew just seeing the guy walking around captive,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.85,0:55:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经不错了 但还不够吸引眼球\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was good, but that wasn't much of a draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.42,0:55:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但亲自拉操纵杆呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But pulling the lever yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.79,0:55:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,就称得上是景点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's an attraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.55,0:55:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.57,0:55:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.15,0:55:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,道森的疼痛技术为这个铺了路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawson's pain tech had paved the way for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.67,0:56:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美重现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A perfect re-creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.31,0:56:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,电刑的痛苦感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}of exactly how the agony of electrocution feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.94,0:56:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一伏都完全仿真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every volt simulated for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.85,0:56:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键是不能让他在最大电压中超过15秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Key was, never let him exceed 15 seconds at max voltage.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.10,0:56:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会永远删除他的数字突触 杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would wipe his digital synapses out for good, kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.23,0:56:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,10秒看上去是最佳电击时长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten seconds seemed to be the optimum shock length,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.99,0:56:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此成了没法解除的限制\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that became the intractable limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.69,0:56:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. Have a little rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.90,0:56:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,适应一下你的新房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get used to your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.36,0:56:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天就正式开馆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Official opening's tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.59,0:56:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实早期时候 接待所有访客才是个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, in the early days, the problem was fitting everyone in.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.93,0:56:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你别这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.90,0:56:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你 求你 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please, please, please, please. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.78,0:57:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't do it. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.92,0:57:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.48,0:57:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,纪念品才是推动销量的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was really the souvenirs that were driving trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.49,0:57:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,实在是太美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.86,0:57:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次你对他处刑后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time you finished juicing him,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.13,0:57:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器就会吐出有知觉的克莱顿快照\N{\fnArial\fs30}out pops a conscious sentient snapshot of Clayton,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.50,0:57:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是录像 而是他思维的真实复制品\N{\fnArial\fs30}not a recording, a true copy of his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.20,0:57:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远经历着这美丽的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}perpetually experiencing that beautiful pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.87,0:57:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远被困在忍受极度痛苦的那一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuck forever in that one perfect moment of agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.47,0:57:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,开关总是拉下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always on.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.52,0:57:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远在受苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.64,0:57:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是你所说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what you'd call…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.63,0:57:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,袖珍版\N{\fnArial\fs30}fun size.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.97,0:57:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能好受些就坐下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a seat if it makes it easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.72,0:58:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.91,0:58:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 我的口音吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? My accent?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.42,0:58:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是英国佬的口音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not fucking British.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.03,0:58:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉让你失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to disappoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.82,0:58:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.25,0:58:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你隐瞒了一部分故事 海恩斯先生 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left some parts of the story out, Mr. Haynes. Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.85,0:58:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘了提那些抗议\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forgot to mention the protests.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.14,0:58:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的妻子发起了一场运动 吸引了关注\N{\fnArial\fs30}His wife started a campaign, got some momentum behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.07,0:58:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会称之为「圣母」的扯淡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess you'd call it virtue-signaling bullshit,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.49,0:58:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道这让你的访客量减少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I know it hurt your attendance.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.78,0:58:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来 抗议者都觉得无聊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even the protesters got bored after a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.43,0:58:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为州政府显然\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as it was clear the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.87,0:59:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不打算帮他洗清罪名\N{\fnArial\fs30}wouldn't do a damn thing about clearing him,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.35,0:59:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们转向了另一个爆红的司法不公案例\N{\fnArial\fs30}they just moved onto the next viral miscarriage of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.79,0:59:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好打标签蹭热度\N{\fnArial\fs30}they can hang a hashtag off of.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.64,0:59:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们完成了任务 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they did their job, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.18,0:59:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方上了黑名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place was on the shit list.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.44,0:59:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那之后你的核心顾客群是谁呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was your core clientele after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.61,0:59:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你失去了一日游旅客 游客\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost the day trippers, the tourists,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.84,0:59:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,家庭访客 还剩谁呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}fun family crowd. Who was left?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.97,0:59:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是你 你个一脸死人像的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You again, you pasty-faced motherfucker?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.38,0:59:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不合群的人 虐待狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loners. Sadists.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.54,0:59:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,极端种族主义疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The supremacist sicko demographic.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.25,0:59:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 出去出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, no, no. Out, out, out.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.32,0:59:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这些人还不够多\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that crowd's not big enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.26,0:59:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你依然入不敷出\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't keep the lights on.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.19,0:59:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果有人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if someone shows up,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.65,0:59:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,典型的种族仇恨的富人 疯狂想要施虐\N{\fnArial\fs30}some classic race-hate rich guy with a hard-on for power…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.98,0:59:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他给你一些额外费用让他处刑久一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he slips you some extra for a longer time at the crank…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.96,0:59:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就欣然接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}you take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.89,1:00:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.50,1:00:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那之后就不同了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't the same after that, was he?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.18,1:00:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有死去 但也不算还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not dead but hardly alive either.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.86,1:00:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使变态也不想折磨一个植物人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the perverts didn't wanna pull a… a lever on a vegetable.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.93,1:00:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还有什么乐趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the joy in that?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.58,1:00:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有人来看过他 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But someone came to see him, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.79,1:00:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看到了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}She saw him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.90,1:00:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就站在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She stood on this spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.85,1:00:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你对他做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw what you had done to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.10,1:00:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clay?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.76,1:00:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就像个温顺的动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was like a docile animal.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.51,1:00:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,天知道他是否还认得她\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows if he even recognized her.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.73,1:00:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,天知道他是否还认得我\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows if he even recognizes me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.79,1:01:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.33,1:01:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,生日快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.55,1:02:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈在那天看到的情景超出了她的承受能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}What my mom saw that day was more than she could take.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.22,1:02:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在运动中曾希望能洗刷他的污名\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had hoped during the whole fight to clear his name,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.33,1:02:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这让她崩溃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that broke her.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.46,1:02:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道她回家后做了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what she did when she came home?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.34,1:02:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一瓶药 一瓶伏特加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bottle of pills and a bottle of vodka.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.09,1:02:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我发现了她 你这个人渣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found her. You fucking piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.56,1:02:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是很热\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it hot?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.15,1:02:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是很潮 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's humid, right? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.38,1:02:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,愚蠢的数字空调\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid digital AC.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.90,1:02:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,很容易黑掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy to hack.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.41,1:02:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远别接受陌生人给的饮料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never accept drinks from strangers.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.94,1:02:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸教我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daddy taught me that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.08,1:02:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你的唇色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going by the color of your lips,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.61,1:02:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你30秒之内就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna be gone in 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.30,1:02:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.53,1:02:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会在另一边看到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna see you on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.94,1:03:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑说你醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computer says you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.50,1:03:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你 你是个先驱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations. You're a pioneer.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.38,1:03:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.86,1:03:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来将一个新鲜的意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}It turns out that it is possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.08,1:03:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,转移到一个虚拟载体里是可行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to transfer a fresh consciousness inside a virtual one.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.44,1:03:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸要载你一程\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daddy's giving you a ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.36,1:03:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去 你个臭…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of here, you fucking cun…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.20,1:03:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你在尖叫着咒骂我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing you're screaming and calling me names right now,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.90,1:03:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我听不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I wouldn't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.91,1:03:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你 - 多亏了你 我爸不能说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You… - I mean, my dad can't talk, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.14,1:03:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我猜他会转达你的祝福的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise I'm guessing he'd pass on your goodwill messages.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.10,1:03:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个臭婊子 臭婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fu… You fucking bitch! You fucking bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.77,1:03:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 你马上将尝试另一种新体验\N{\fnArial\fs30}In other news, you'll shortly be undertaking another first.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.71,1:03:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,首次双层安乐死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first double-decker mercy killing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.66,1:04:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.27,1:04:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我解除了十秒的限制\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took off the ten-second limit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.56,1:04:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我爸会接受足量的电击\N{\fnArial\fs30}so Daddy'll get a full hit of juice.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.25,1:04:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该足够让他解脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should be enough to set him free.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.67,1:04:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… however…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.48,1:04:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,海恩斯先生 在他脑内会感同身受\N{\fnArial\fs30}burrowed away inside there, Mr. Haynes, you'll feel it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.98,1:04:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.13,1:04:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去死 - 全部完美的电击\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck y… - Every perfect little shot of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.31,1:04:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去死 - 我也要给自己做一个纪念品\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck you! - I'm getting myself a souvenir, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.56,1:04:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.10,1:04:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你 求你 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, please, please. I…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.81,1:04:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,开关总是拉下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.31,1:04:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 永远在受苦 - 妈的 不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Always suffering. - Fuck! No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.10,1:04:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.33,1:05:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,小猴爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkey loves you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.92,1:06:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做得如何 妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd I do, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.45,1:06:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All good?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.65,1:06:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just great, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.37,1:06:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.14,1:06:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, thanks.
